title Aspire Super Admin DFD Level 0 - Overview
rectangle "Super Admin" as actor_in
database "D1: Users" as users_in
database "D2: Centers" as centers_in
usecase "4.0\nDisplay overview" as process
rectangle "Super Admin" as actor_out
actor_in --> process : Overview request
users_in --> process : Administrator records
